SUMMARY:Victorian Christmas: Customs & Costumes
DESCRIPTION:Step back in time and discover how many of our favorite holiday
  traditions began! Join historian Lynnette Miller from Landis Valley for a
  fascinating look into the holiday customs\, festive decorations\, and sea
 sonal fashions of the Victorian era. From decorated evergreen trees and ha
 ndmade gifts to period-appropriate winter attire\, this presentation explo
 res how Victorian-era families celebrated the holiday season. The presenta
 tion will be followed by a Q&A session with the audience. Free and open to
  the public. Registration is requested.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nSchedule listed:
  Tue\, Dec 15\, 2026 06:00 PM EST – Tue\, Dec 15\, 2026 07:45 PM EST\n\n
